{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_30","type":"agent_message","text":"I’ve imported the pinned engine and Hub client and checked the source’s visual reference. I’ll keep the north-up, small-car countryside view and use native engine shapes for the cars and landmarks. Race progress will use directed gates so nearby roads, resets, and start-line crossings cannot grant false laps or pursuit points.\n"}}
