{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_144","type":"agent_message","text":"The comprehensive pass passed 165 of 167 checks. The two failures exposed an AI behavior problem: both drivers followed the same center line and queued against each other until a scoreless draw. I’m giving two-car AI safe left/right racing lines so the faster motor can pass, then checking that pursuit play ends with points on the board.\n"}}
