: final comprehensive pass (expected 171 checks), final still/filmstrip inspection, validation summary and completion.\\\\n';p.write_text(s)\nPY\nbiome check --write src tools tests/*.mjs --diagnostic-level=error > docs/evidence/biome-final.log 2>&1\nruff check tests/browser.py > docs/evidence/ruff-final.log 2>&1\nnode tools/test.mjs core\nnode tools/build.mjs\nnode tools/test.mjs all\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
