{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_167","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nimport json,hashlib\nfrom pathlib import Path\ncfg=json.loads(Path('build-config.json').read_text());p=Path('../'+cfg['stem']+'.html');data=p.read_bytes()\nproof={'filename':p.name,'bytes':len(data),'sha256':hashlib.sha256(data).hexdigest(),'reportSha256':hashlib.sha256(Path('../exit-interview.json').read_bytes()).hexdigest(),'fullIntegration':json.loads(Path('docs/evidence/tests-all.json').read_text())['total'],'fullIntegrationFailures':json.loads(Path('docs/evidence/tests-all.json').read_text())['failed']}\nPath('docs/evidence/deliverable.json').write_text(json.dumps(proof,indent=2)+'\\\\n')\nissues=Path('docs/issues.md');issues.write_text(issues.read_text().replace('Final visual inspection pending.','Final 1920×1080 still shows speed, pickup and cornering bars together.'))\np=Path('../PROGRESS.md');s=p.read_text()+'\\\\n## Final evidence\\\\n- Full core/integration suite: 171 checks, 0 failures (docs/evidence/tests-all.json).\\\\n- Final packaging: 8 checks, 0 failures. Final visual capture: 2 checks, 0 failures.\\\\n- Final setup still inspected: all three car bars visible at 1920×1080. Four-frame real steering/skid/braking filmstrip captured and inspected.\\\\n- 13 unique issues fixed, 5 critical; root exit-interview.json and in-game feedback agree.\\\\n- Last tiny Hub UI polish uses a disabled waiting-status control. Rebuilding and rerunning package/official Hub checks before declaring complete.\\\\n- Deliverable hash and byte count: docs/evidence/deliverable.json.\\\\n';p.write_text(s)\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
